<title>HONG KONG: Tai Ping Carpets yr net loss HK$78.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Tai Ping Carpets yr net loss HK$78.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   81.0 loss  vs  7.0 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  68.59 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    78.21 loss vs  6.35 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     296.75     vs  287.89</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tai Ping Carpets International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Tai Ping manufactures carpets.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional items of HK$68.59 million loss on provision for slow moving stock, doubtful debts, diminution in value of investments and joint ventures, but before extraordinary items of HK$46.72 million gain on disposal of properties and disposal of listed investments vs HK$24.36 million gain.</p>
<p>The company does not comply with Hong Kong Statement of Standard Accounting Practice No. 2, which requires items shown as extraordinary be treated as exceptional.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs four H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
